            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="deal-time" aria-label="Time remaining">
            <div class="time-box"><strong id="days">00</strong><span>Days</span></div>
            <div class="time-box"><strong id="hours">00</strong><span>Hours</span></div>
            <div class="time-box"><strong id="minutes">00</strong><span>Minutes</span></div>
            <div class="time-box"><strong id="seconds">00</strong><span>Seconds</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="deal-list">
            <div class="deal-item">
              <div>
                <strong>Bundle & save</strong>
                <small>Buy 2 accessories, get 15% off</small>
              </div>
              <span class="price">-15%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="deal-item">
              <div>
                <strong>Free shipping</strong>
                <small>Orders over $75 ship free</small>
              </div>
              <span class="price">$0</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card large">
          <div class="story">
            <span class="spotlight-tag">Editor pick</span>
            <h3>Minimalist layers for city-to-weekend travel</h3>
            <p>
              A lightweight jacket, relaxed tee, and technical sneaker create a tonal uniform that
              feels polished without trying too hard.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-visual" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="feature-meta">
            <div>
              <strong>Travel capsule</strong>
              <div class="kicker">From $42</div>
            </div>
            <a class="ghost-btn" href="#stories">Explore the look</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="stories" class="section" aria-labelledby="stories-title">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <h2 id="stories-title">Editorial content</h2>
          <p>Short reads and product stories designed to inspire the next cart.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid editorial-grid">
        <article class="editorial-card">
          <div class="visual" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <span class="spotlight-tag">Style guide</span>
          <h3>How to build a dark-toned capsule wardrobe</h3>
          <p>Five pieces, one palette, and a simple formula for effortless outfits all week.</p>
          <a class="ghost-btn" href="#">Read story</a>
        </article>
        <article class="editorial-card">
          <div class="visual" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <span class="spotlight-tag">Behind the design</span>
          <h3>Why tactile fabrics matter in modern basics</h3>
          <p>Texture and fit do more than catch the eye—they carry comfort through the day.</p>
          <a class="ghost-btn" href="#">Read story</a>
        </article>
        <article class="editorial-card">
          <div class="visual" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <span class="spotlight-tag">New arrival</span>
          <h3>Home accents that sharpen a room instantly</h3>
          <p>Small-format objects with strong silhouettes can change the mood of a space fast.</p>
          <a class="ghost-btn" href="#">Read story</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="shell">
    <div class="footer-card">
      <div>
        <strong>Northstar Supply</strong>
        <div>Retail goods, styled for a polished dark experience.</div>
      </div>
      <div>Support: hello@northstarsupply.example</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    const products = [
      {
        name: "Aero Knit Jacket",
        category: "apparel",
        price: 128,
        rating: 5,
        note: "Breathable, water-resistant, and cut for layering.",
        tag: "New"
      },
      {
        name: "Contour Runner",
        category: "footwear",
        price: 148,
        rating: 5,
        note: "Lightweight cushioning with a stable heel profile.",
        tag: "Best seller"
      },
      {
        name: "Slate Loop Bag",
        category: "apparel",
        price: 84,
        rating: 4,
        note: "Everyday carry with a matte finish and hidden pocket.",
        tag: "Limited"
      },
      {
        name: "Studio Lamp",
        category: "home",
        price: 96,
        rating: 5,
        note: "Warm dimmable light with a compact sculptural base.",
        tag: "Home"
      }
    ];

    const productGrid = document.getElementById("productGrid");
    const chips = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(".chip"));
    const search = document.getElementById("search");
    const countdown = document.getElementById("days").parentElement.parentElement;

    function stars(count) {
      return "★★★★★".slice(0, count) + "☆☆☆☆☆".slice(0, 5 - count);
    }

    function renderProducts(filter = "all", query = "") {
      const lowerQuery = query.trim().toLowerCase();
      const items = products.filter((product) => {
        const matchesFilter = filter === "all" || product.category === filter;
        const matchesQuery = !lowerQuery || `${product.name} ${product.note} ${product.category}`.toLowerCase().includes(lowerQuery);
        return matchesFilter && matchesQuery;
      });

      productGrid.innerHTML = items.map((product) => `
        <article class="product-card">
          <div class="thumb" aria-hidden="true"><span>${product.name.split(" ").map(word => word[0]).join("")}</span></div>
          <div class="product-meta">
            <span class="spotlight-tag">${product.tag}</span>
            <span class="price">$${product.price}</span>
          </div>
          <h3>${product.name}</h3>
          <p>${product.note}</p>
          <div class="product-meta" style="margin-top: .85rem;">
            <span class="rating" aria-label="${product.rating} out of 5 stars">${stars(product.rating)}</span>
            <button class="ghost-btn" type="button">Add to cart</button>
          </div>
        </article>
      `).join("");

      if (!items.length) {
        productGrid.innerHTML = `
          <div class="section-card" style="grid-column: 1 / -1; padding: 1.25rem;">
            <strong>No products match your search.</strong>
            <p style="color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.35rem;">Try a different keyword or category.</p>
          </div>
        `;
      }
    }

    chips.forEach((chip) => {
      chip.addEventListener("click", () => {
        chips.forEach((btn) => btn.setAttribute("aria-pressed", "false"));
        chip.setAttribute("aria-pressed", "true");
        renderProducts(chip.dataset.filter, search.value);
      });
    });

    search.addEventListener("input", () => {
